 "schema": "checkpath.parser-divergence/v1",
 "note": "FIX-P0-08 multiline-quoted-unindented parity fixtures: the `yaml` package rejects a multi-line quoted scalar whose continuation line is indented less than or equal to its block context (\"Missing closing \\\"quote\"), while PyYAML accepts any indent. The Oracle now rejects the same shapes through _reject_underindented_multiline_quoted_scalar (oracle/checkpath_oracle/parser.py) with the identical yaml_parse_error, in both parse_workflow_yaml and extract_jobs. The rule: every continuation line must be indented strictly more than the innermost enclosing block collection (mapping value: key indent; sequence item: dash indent; flow item: enclosing block indent); empty or spaces-only lines are skipped, tab-only lines are not. f06 / f08 / f10 / f12 / f14 / f15 / f18 / f21 are the VALID boundaries: both sides accept.",
